    "title": "Stop & Shop will close early on Easter Sunday. Here's what we know",
    "text": "GROCERY STORESStop & Shop to close several hours early this day. What to knowBailey AllenUSA TODAY NETWORK - New EnglandUpdated March 31, 2026, 2:15 p.m. ETStop & Shop is closing most of its grocery stores several hours early this Sunday.Easter is Sunday, April 5, this year, and many supermarkets across the country are closing for part or all of the day to give employees the opportunity to spend time with loved ones.Stop & Shop, which operates more than 360 stores on the East Coast, will close many of its Rhode Island locations before dinnertime that day.",
